# 8. How would you write a script to monitor disk usage and send an alert when usage exceeds 80%?
I would use the df -h command to check disk usage, compare the usage percentage with a threshold value (80%), and send an alert using email or a notification tool if the usage exceeds the limit. This helps prevent disk space issues before they impact applications.

